New Zealand,NZL,10. Can state cyber operations that deny access to or degrade data in the control of another State constitute a violation of sovereignty as a rule?,Silent,,,,,
New Zealand,NZL,10(a) Do state sponsored ransomware operations violate the sovereignty of another State?,Silent,,,,,
